\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6.9}{\ignorespaces Binary OK / Not-OK ROC curves of the clarifier models. The dotted line marks the 95\% target recall. The legend in (b) gives the population standard deviation, so it differs slightly from Table~\ref {tab:res_binary_clarifier}.}}{83}{figure.caption.67}%
